  "question": "Can New York City agencies use the M/WBE small purchase method for human services?",
  "status": "answered",
  "answer": "No, New York City agencies cannot use the M/WBE small purchase method for human services. The NYC PPB Rules explicitly prohibit agencies from making purchases pursuant to the M/WBE small purchase subparagraph for human services. This rule is part of New York City's procurement regulations.",
